#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div:4-13
msgid "Ceno is building a borderless internet"
msgstr "Ceno正在建立一个无边界的互联网"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:5-13
msgid "Our motto is ‘Share the Web!' because that is what our users do."
msgstr ""

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.p:12-13
msgid ""
"There are many tools available to people who face internet restrictions, but "
"these tools often don't help people in the midst of internet shutdowns, "
"blockages, VPN breaks and other disruptions.<br><b>Ceno is different.</b> "
"People using Ceno Browser are able to access a library of saved internet "
"content that continues to be available during service interruptions."
msgstr ""
"面对网络限制的人们可以使用许多工具，但这些工具往往无法在互联网中断、封锁、VPN"
"故障及其他干扰发生时提供帮助。<br><b>Ceno 则不同。</b>使用 Ceno 浏览器的用户"
"能够访问一个事先保存的互联网内容库，即使在服务中断期间，这些内容依然可用。"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:16-21
msgid ""
"That's where sharing the web comes in: users with access to content or a "
"stable network help to collect and share content with those who don't. This "
"means, for example, that <b>a Ceno user in Azerbaijan can read a blocked "
"article if another Ceno user in Italy has pulled up the same one.</b> This "
"is made possible by people running Ceno from countries with more reliable "
"and open access to the internet – we call these users \"<b>Bridges</b>\". "
"Bridges can share content with people using Ceno in heavily restricted "
"networks."
msgstr ""

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.a.div:19-89
msgid "Become a bridge"
msgstr ""

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.div.a.div:20-67
msgid "Learn how Ceno works"
msgstr "了解Ceno如何运作"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.h2:28-13
msgid "The team behind Ceno"
msgstr "Ceno背后的团队"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.p:30-17
msgid ""
"Ceno is created and maintained by the Canadian not-for-profit organization "
"<a href=\"https://equalitie.org\">eQualitie</a> in support of Articles 18, "
"19 and 20 of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights. We have over ten "
"years of experience creating and advancing tools to protect freedom of "
"speech, facilitate information exchange, and promote self-expression on the "
"internet."
msgstr ""

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.p:31-17
msgid ""
"Ceno — and all accompanying components of the tool that together create a "
"decentralized network of peers and nodes — is free and open source software. "
"You can <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/ceno-app\">inspect our code</a> or re-"
"create the entire network yourself!"
msgstr ""
"Ceno——以及构成该工具的所有配套组件，共同构建了一个去中心化的对等节点网络——是"
"完全免费自由的开源软件。您可以<a href=\"https://gitlab.com/ceno-app\">查阅我"
"们的代码</a>，甚至亲手重建整个网络！"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.h2:44-17
msgid "Is Ceno for me?"
msgstr "Ceno适合我吗？"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:46-21
msgid ""
"Ceno is for everyone. It can replace your existing mobile browser as it "
"shares many of the same functions and features."
msgstr ""
"Ceno适合所有人。它能替代您现有的手机浏览器，因为它具备许多相同的功能和特性。"

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:47-21
msgid ""
"If you're running Ceno from a region with open access to the internet, "
"you'll access content the same way you would on a mainstream browser. The "
"benefit is that you can choose to help other Ceno users while you browse by "
"becoming a Bridge."
msgstr ""

#: about.html%2Bmain.section.div.div.div.p:48-21
msgid ""
"Ceno is especially useful for people facing internet censorship or "
"connectivity issues."
msgstr "Ceno对面临互联网审查或网络连接问题的人群尤为实用。"

